Exactly 👍 Now you're moving to **Deque**. The nice part is that C++, Java, and Python all have a deque concept, but the method names are different.

## 🔥 Deque — C++ vs Java vs Python

Think of a deque as:

```text
        FRONT                 BACK
          ↓                    ↓
       [ 10 ][ 20 ][ 30 ][ 40 ]
          ↑                    ↑
      add/remove          add/remove
```

You can add/remove from **both ends**.

---

## 1. Creating a Deque

### C++

```cpp
deque<int> dq;
